# Optional: switch the contact form from the built-in FormSubmit fallback to
# Formspree. Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env*` is gitignored — never
# commit real values.
#
# Formspree form ID: formspree.io -> New Form -> Integration -> Form URL,
# e.g. https://formspree.io/f/abcdefgh -> VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=abcdefgh
#
# Leave this unset to use FormSubmit instead: the form posts to SITE.email
# (https://formsubmit.co) with no account needed. The destination inbox gets a
# one-time activation email on the first submission and must confirm it.
#
# This is the public endpoint identifier, not a secret: it is already exposed in
# the no-JS <form action> fallback. Do NOT add Formspree API keys, SMTP
# credentials, or any other secret to a VITE_* variable — Vite inlines them into
# the client bundle where anyone can read them.
VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=
